# Allowlist: ignore everything, then allow only website code and config.
# Real bank exports, backups and personal files can never be committed by accident.
*

!.gitignore
!.github/
!.github/**
!CLAUDE.md
!README.md
!index.html
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!vite.config.js
!.oxlintrc.json
!public/
!public/**
!src/
!src/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**

# Even inside src/public, never real data files
*.csv
!src/lib/__tests__/fixtures/*.csv
*.json.bak
*backup*.json

# Installed Claude skills (see .claude/skills/SOURCES.md). Only this folder; local settings stay ignored.
!.claude/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
# Skill data tables are CSVs; allow them under the skills folder only
!.claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/data/**/*.csv
!.claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/data/*.csv

# The screenshot reader is copied from node_modules at build time (scripts/copy-ocr.mjs), never committed
public/ocr/
